{"id": "EUVD-2026-102844", "enisaUuid": "efd07f83-33c3-3f8f-bf41-1b29bdf4797d", "description": "Erupt through 2.3.0 contains an HQL injection vulnerability that allows authenticated users to bypass tree-scoped data filters by injecting unescaped quotes into the linkTreeVal parameter of POST /erupt-api/data/table/{erupt}. Attackers holding query permission on entities with String-keyed linkTree targets can append always-true OR clauses or boolean subqueries to read data from other mapped entities.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T11:38:02", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T02:18:10", "baseScore": 6.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/m0EK1XcGQfua6QHIXXNqMQ", "https://github.com/erupts/erupt/blob/2.3.0/erupt-core/src/main/java/xyz/erupt/core/service/EruptService.java#L62-L71", "https://github.com/erupts/erupt/blob/2.3.0/erupt-core/src/main/java/xyz/erupt/core/util/TypeUtil.java#L107-L115", "https://github.com/erupts/erupt/blob/2.3.0/erupt-data/erupt-data-jpa/src/main/java/xyz/erupt/jpa/dao/EruptJpaUtils.java#L210-L212", "https://github.com/erupts/erupt", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/erupt-through-2.3.0-hql-injection-via-linktreeval-in-data-table-api"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111390", "GHSA-qh8g-m9r5-r3mw"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "17b0e663-777a-383b-aa15-c6db0663172e", "product": {"name": "erupt", "vendor": {"name": "erupts"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.3.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4754459a-e6f9-3469-9867-ee720096de16", "vendor": {"name": "erupts"}}], "isExploited": false}